==================================================================
 AXI4 2x1 bus debug trace
 Line format:  [time] SRC CH dir txn=M<route>.<W|R><id>  <fields>
   SRC = M0|M1 (master), ARB (arbiter), SLV (slave)
   CH  = AW/W/B (write path),  AR/R (read path)
   dir = >> request (master->slave),  << response (slave->master)
   txn = M<route>.<W|R><id> : route = originating master,
         W/R = write or read path, id = local AXI ID. Same key on
         every hop; write and read keys are distinct, so e.g.
         grep 'txn=M0.W2' (write) vs grep 'txn=M0.R2' (read).
